sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as 도크
  participant J as JsonMessagedHandler
  participant CH as DataCollectorChannel
  participant DC as DataCollectorService
  participant SM as StateManager
  participant DB as ftmsdb
  participant HUB as ChatHub
  D->>J: {"type":"process_count",<br/>ProcessCounts[이번, 누적]}
  J->>CH: WriteAsync(json) → OK 응답
  CH->>DC: ReadAllAsync (단일 소비자)
  DC->>DC: 보정 (빈값 "-",<br/>DockId←ClientId/RawData)
  par 실시간 누적 (1초)
    DC->>SM: RemoveTimeoutProcessCountsAsync
    DC->>SM: AccumProcessCountFromClientAsync<br/>(최근 5분 슬라이딩)
  and 원본 적재 (1초 / 2만건)
    DC->>DB: Flush → collected_payload<br/>(CSV 텍스트)
  and 원본 처리 (연속)
    DC->>DB: process_collected_payload_v4()
    DB-->>DC: Loaded/Deduped/Inserted/Updated
    DC->>HUB: CollectedCountReceived
  and 집계 (1초)
    DC->>DB: process_counts_aggregate_all(20000)
    DB->>DB: 분/시/일/일(KST) 누적 테이블
  end
  Note over DC,DB: 집계 루프는 try/catch 없음<br/>→ DB 오류 1회로 정지 (B6)
